=== M. 17 CFR 240.16a-4: Derivative securities ===
official caption typography is Derivative securities.
16a-4(a): For purposes of section 16 of the Act, both derivative securities and the underlying securities to which they relate shall be deemed to be the same class of equity securities, except that the acquisition or disposition of any derivative security shall be separately reported.
16a-4(b): The exercise or conversion of a call equivalent position shall be reported on Form 4 and treated for reporting purposes as:
16a-4(b)(1): A purchase of the underlying security; and
16a-4(b)(2): A closing of the derivative security position.
16a-4(c): The exercise or conversion of a put equivalent position shall be reported on Form 4 and treated for reporting purposes as:
16a-4(c)(1): A sale of the underlying security; and
16a-4(c)(2): A closing of the derivative security position.
16a-4(d): The disposition or closing of a long derivative security position, as a result of cancellation or expiration, shall be exempt from section 16(a) of the Act if exempt from section 16(b) of the Act pursuant to § 240.16b-6(d).
official typography italicizes "except that" with no trailing comma inside the italics
